@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@cityId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

# TODO : Set baseUrl from launchSettings or your deployed environment. Scaffold calls return 501.
### Published cities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cities
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Search published places
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/places?CityId={{cityId}}&Page=1&PageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Proposed personalized map viewport
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/map?CityId={{cityId}}&West=51.2&South=35.6&East=51.6&North=35.9&Layer=learning
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
